  "sourceTitle": "Champagne Punch",
  "sourceText": "Champagne Punch\nBy: Karlyn Oyama\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 12:03am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 sm. cans lemonade\n1 lg. can frozen orange juice\n1/2 gal. orange sherbet\n1 bottle pink champagne\n4 qts. 7-Up\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend first 3 ingredients in blender. Do not dilute juices. Add champagne and soda. (Just as good without champagne also).",
